  "rules": [
    "Complete/skip modify scheduled therapy task and owning prescription aggregate; prescription/therapy context is local only for these wire operations.",
    "Add/remove are prescription-wide and affect all in-progress therapy tasks, not only the currently viewed therapy.",
    "Terminate therapy can also terminate prescription when all therapies are terminal; all prescription writes share ordering.",
    "Legacy advice handler loops remote steps with one overall status. Native steps retain separate immutable input, attempts and bound receipts.",
    "CreatePrescription is declared but has no active old app caller. Backend recordId is a random serial, not the generated prescription ID; no local reference mapping is inferred.",
    "Complete and skip create next rounds per modified target on backend. Legacy frontend waits for all current dose rows; do not copy that simplified projection.",
    "Cached list uses active prescription statuses OR task executed_at within the day window. Full list filters must remain distinct from home/cache selection."
  ]
